DO NOT generate:

- placeholder fake logic pretending to work
- TODO-driven core infrastructure
- mocked production pathways without labels
- pseudo-implementations disguised as finished systems

Temporary stubs MUST:

- be explicitly labeled
- expose limitations
- fail safely
- never masquerade as production-ready

